{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandate Better Police Training & Presence to Make the Night-Time Economy Safer",
        "additional_details": "Requested actions:\r\n\u2022 Mandate SIA training for police on door supervisors, licensed premises & operations to boost collaboration/enforcement.\r\n\u2022 Provide customer service & de-escalation training for effective engagement in night-time situations.\r\n\u2022 Establish formal protocols for communication, support & rapid response between police, venues & SIA door staff.\r\n\u2022 Increase proactive policing & visible presence in night-time hotspots during peak hours to deter crime\r\n",
        "background": "We call on Government to help public safety within the NTE by mandating police training on SIA guidelines & customer service, strengthening communication with venues, staff & door supervisors, & increasing policing & visible presence. We believe this will reduce violence and make nights out safer.",
